{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47392","headline":"题本竹观 · 杜光庭","name":"题本竹观","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楼阁层层冠此山，雕轩朱槛一跻攀。\n碑刊古篆龙蛇动，洞接诸天日月闲。\n帝子影堂香漠漠，真人丹涧水潺潺。\n扫空双竹今何在，只恐投波去不还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47392.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47392","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}